  Cell["The Fig. 4 dashed instability branches are thresholds for nonoptimal \
disks, separate from the energy minimum. The following coarse radius scan \
estimates those branches without suppressing negative physical energies. \
These threshold curves are resolved only to the stated radius spacing.", 
   "Text"], Cell[CellGroupData[
    {Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"thresholdFields", "=", 
           RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0.25`", ",", "0.35`", ",", "0.45`", ",", 
